--- stderr
Migrated legacy.plumber.yaml → legacy.plumber.yaml.v2
  - renamed github.controls.releaseWorkflowsMustNotRestoreUntrustedCache to untrustedTriggersMustNotWriteCache
  - dropped publishActions, cacheActions (the control no longer detects release jobs)
Review the result, then replace the original with:
